1,9 $ Growing on Gilled Mushrooms 
1,9 ,n$ Notes such as Agaricus, Amanita, Armillaria, Clitocybe, Collybia, Coprinus, Crepidotus, Entoloma, Gymnopus, Lactarius, Leptonia, Marasmius, Mycena, Nolanea, Pholiota, Pleurotus, Pouzarella, Russula, and Tubaria

